{"ID":"20240220132644-tddzcth","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132644-tddzcth","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132644-tddzcth\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312150958-uv4n73r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312150606-5u67ou9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312151051-o1i3yl7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:87,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:87\u0026#125;","title":"【麻黄汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312151051"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312150958-uv4n73r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-uv4n73r","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三十九条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-3yyxhjt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-3yyxhjt","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳病」,头痛,发热,身疼,腰痛,骨节疼痛,恶风,无汗而喘者,「麻黄汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-kyy2ree","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-kyy2ree","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-03jwew7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-03jwew7","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄三两（去节）,桂枝三两（去皮）,甘草一两（炙）,杏仁七十枚（去皮尖）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-phppcpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-phppcpy","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，以水九升，先煮麻黄减二升，去上沫，纳诸药，煮取二升半，去滓，温服八合，覆取微似汗，不须粥饮，余如桂枝汤法将息。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-4pigpzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-4pigpzy","updated":"20240312150958"}},{"ID":"20240312150958-94ldt5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-94ldt5f","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是太阳伤寒，伤寒伤到当令的节气，并不是时疫，不会传染的。他恶寒到什么程度，夏天你热的要死，他一滴汗都不出，冷的要死。这个伤寒不一定是冬天的寒，而是伤于寒，伤到是来自寒，比如冷气。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-6dk9h4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-6dk9h4o","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要症状，头痛，发热，身疼腰痛，骨节疼痛，恶风无汗而喘，为什么没汗？是这样子，我们常常"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"问汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是想知道他的肠胃系统如何，他的心脏功能如何，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心脏功能很好，你运动才会出汗，你走路才会出汗，你吃饭才会出汗，心脏功能不好，一种是完全没有汗，一种是你不动就会流汗，不该出汗的时候出汗。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-8n0zg04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-8n0zg04","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们知道"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治肾脏一定要去救心脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以肾脏有问题的病人，他再运动，一点汗都没有，你怎么知道他病治好了，他一动就出汗，就好了。病人只要有汗，就不会有积水。就是我昨天讲的那个吸管，你把按着的手一放掉，水就跑出来了。所以只要一运动以后，有汗，下身就不会有积水，小便就会恢复正常。所以这个汗很重要。这个人现在没有汗了，喘为什么？因为伤于寒的时候，毛孔整个闭锁注了，那你呼吸就靠鼻子两个孔在呼吸，你鼻孔再大，也还是喘。所以喘无汗，是伤寒的主症，还有全身骨节疼痛，寒束在身上的时候，好像被鞭子打很痛，因为水没有办法走动，当热是有恶风。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-antxatz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-antxatz","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种伤于寒的现象出现的时候要开麻黄汤。一般临床上的时候，大家看到麻黄的时候想这个发表发的很厉害，吃下流汗流的很快，比较担心。看到使用麻黄，就拿两根，称不到重量的，麻黄质很轻。比如桂枝三钱，麻黄三钱，麻黄三钱拿到手上一大票，桂枝三钱一点点，那个质不一样啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-4dp53b7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-4dp53b7","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里麻黄剂量比桂枝剂量多，记得是黄金比例啊，当你要用麻黄汤的时候，你确定他是麻黄汤的时候，你开出来是开比例的。桂枝比麻黄少一点点，炙甘草，还有杏仁，四味药组成汤叫做麻黄汤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄汤有一个外号叫做返魂汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以麻黄不是说只有发表流汗，最重要是把阳气生发起来，发阳。越婢汤的时候我们会用麻黄跟石膏，前面桂枝二越婢一汤的时候，有没有，让他阳气起来。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经方遇到病人阴虚的时候，我们开的是强阳的药，让他阴自回。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阴，就是津液，你看的到的就是阴，脏腑吸收的能力是阳，力量就是阳。张仲景的经方的观念，就是说要把阳回来以后，阴会自己回头，这个才是真正的治愈。所以张仲景的观念是，你生病了，我们给你个药推你一下，然后你胃气恢复了，开始吃东西了，好了，这就是经方的观念。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"经方不像西药一样，要吃一辈子，经方就是刺激你的身体，让你的身体功能自己恢复以后，所有的功能都在你身体自己的控制之下，这个时候你就好了，所以你受伤的伤口，我们开药就是让你自己痊愈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么西药不能把病治愈，因为西药只是控制，因为他认为病不会痊愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-iht7c81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-iht7c81","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黄跟杏仁用在一起，杏仁跟石膏不太一样，中药里面，所有仁剂的，都有油脂，白色能够入肺，除了增润肺的津液以外，同时可以涤痰，把痰排掉。石膏是石头没有油，所以石膏是去热的。麻黄汤里面要用杏仁，不能用石膏。当你要发汗的时候，炙甘草下去可以让肠胃产生很多的津液，桂枝是一个马，麻黄是一个人骑着马，麻黄骑上桂枝，麻黄碰上桂枝才有办法到皮肤表面上去，所以你看葛根汤里面是不是桂枝加上麻黄，汗才会走表。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-xk8e27k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-xk8e27k","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果麻黄没有桂枝的时候，它不会出汗的。它是发阳，阳气会起来。这里我们要借用桂枝，麻黄才可以到表，发汗。杏仁，因为麻黄入肺，能够把肺打开来，把毛孔打开来，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以麻黄吃下去，流出来的汗是从肺里面流出来的，肺的津液会不够，这时候就预先放下杏仁去补它的，就怕肺的津液不够，如果麻黄汤里不加杏仁，直接是麻黄杏仁炙甘草下去，病人肺里面的津液没了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，燥渴，全身会发热，肺就想水箱，心脏好像引擎，水箱跟引擎比例要相等才会有恒温，如果水箱里水不够了，引擎是好的，车子温度是不是过热，所以你摸这个病人发烧，因为你没有加杏仁在里面，就好像水箱里面水没了，你光是看引擎，检查引擎没有问题，忘掉水箱里水没了。这就是杏仁的功能。杏仁七颗差不多三克，七十颗差不多，二十一克了，差不多四钱五钱的量，麻黄三钱，你可以杏仁多加点，无所谓，杏仁可以超过麻黄一点没关系，但是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄比桂枝一定要高一点。这个才是正麻黄汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么叫返魂汤。大陆呢，有的中医呢他用四逆汤，但是他不敢用生附子，他用炮附子，开很重两三百克炮附子救逆（李可），那要不要把附子用到这种程度？其实不需要，用麻黄，麻黄汤就可以了，病人心脏气息都没了，麻黄一下去，肺打开，毛孔打开来，当场就呼吸了，炙甘草桂枝是不是强心阳。所以叫还魂汤。麻黄单味功能不会发表的，只是精神很好，晚上不睡觉。配上其他的就不一样了。麻黄记得不是发汗，发阳的。阳气内陷，或者阳气没了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"发阳用的麻黄汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，救逆的时候可以用。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-jmh6mh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-jmh6mh2","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"光是善用麻黄的人，所有的咳嗽，气喘，肺上面的问题，还有救逆都可以用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。麻黄、桂枝、甘草、杏仁，简单的四味，药简力专是经方的精神。他先煮麻黄。你真正救逆的时候，什么先煮，直接丢下去煮了，真正救逆的时候不要那么讲究，赶快丢下去煮。九碗水煮麻黄，去掉两碗了，在放其他药煮成两碗半，一次服三分之一。覆取微似汗，不需要啜粥。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么要啜粥，就是刺激你肠胃的蠕动。这里不是要肠胃里面的汗，它是解肺里面的汗，所以不需要啜粥。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-zcjka9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-zcjka9n","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最基本杏仁和麻黄要等量，你可以多一点。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-lu9jbj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-lu9jbj9","updated":"20240312150958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太阳中风桂枝汤，太阳伤寒麻黄汤。太阳温病葛根汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150958-kpjk1jj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150958-kpjk1jj"}},{"ID":"20240312150942-f3uuz7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150942-f3uuz7v","updated":"20240312150942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第四十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150942-vh1wjc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150942-vh1wjc1","updated":"20240312150942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳」与「阳明」合病,喘而胸满者,不可下,宜「麻黄汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150942-uv31raw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150942-uv31raw","updated":"20240312150942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们平常有阳明症就代表病进入肠胃了，如果有合病，比如他这个还有太阳病，可是又带点肠胃的问题，有喘而且胸满是病在肺上面，因为喘而胸满我们知道是麻黄汤症，当有麻黄汤症的时候我们知道肺里面有寒，不可以攻下用麻黄汤来解。所以这个伤寒论的原则就是，当有表症应先解表，不可攻下，尤其是伤寒的，病人体痛，恶寒的，结果你没有开麻黄汤，你开大承气汤，他又便秘，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你一攻下的时候会结胸，寒会结在胸，称为结胸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有的时候是吃坏食物被攻下了，这个时候因为他是伤寒，我们这个伤寒跟西医讲的伤寒不一样，我们伤寒是一个症。绝对不可以下，万一被下了，结胸。他这个条辨就是告诉你，不要管其他的，你只要看到有伤寒的症状，喘而胸满，绝对不可以下，一定要先解表。用麻黄汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150942-qowtuv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150942-qowtuv9"}},{"ID":"20240312150933-9p5yz8u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150933-9p5yz8u","updated":"20240312150933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第四十一条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150933-uva3j08","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150933-uva3j08","updated":"20240312150933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「太阳病」,十日已去,脉浮细而嗜卧者,外已解也。设胸满,胁痛者,与「小柴胡汤」,脉但浮者与「麻黄汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150933-0ptg520","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150933-0ptg520","updated":"20240312150933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个太阳病过了一个七天，病会改变，有一种身体很好，肠胃很好的时候，得到太阳病他自己就恢复了，无药而愈，不用吃药就好了。所以我们随时药保持肠胃很好，病就不容易传，容易自愈；"}]},{"ID":"20240312150933-rlsvy79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150933-rlsvy79","updated":"20240312150933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果太阳症没去掉，变成脉浮细，而嗜卧，这个已经是没有表症了，表症有的话不会有这种现象，有胸满胁痛，就是小柴胡汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150933-jm4vnv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150933-jm4vnv5","updated":"20240312150933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小柴胡汤是少阳证的第一个处方。小柴胡汤的主要症状就是胁痛，就是胸胁，胁肋这边，我们叫胸胁苦满。张仲景讲的比较简单，实际上小柴胡汤会有往来寒热、恶心，然后胁肋痛，如果说脉浮者吃麻黄汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150933-61hbirc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150933-61hbirc","updated":"20240312150933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四十一条的原则就是，当你要辩证，如果太阳症已经没有了，进入少阳症的时候，你要知道它已经进入少阳症了，这时候麻黄汤不适合。如果过了十天，或者过了一个节气以后，他脉还是浮在那边，还是在太阳的时候，这个时候还是给他麻黄汤。只要太阳症还在的时候，就用太阳症的药，进入里面的时候，胁痛，胸满，尤其这个胁痛，麻黄汤症我们可以看到胸满，好像重复了，胁痛，太阳没有胁肋痛。这里胁痛实际上就是胸胁苦满，肋骨这一带很胀满，就是已经进入少阳了，这时我们可以用小柴胡汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312151050-7jb76y5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312151050-7jb76y5"}},{"ID":"20240312151051-nn56bjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312151051-nn56bjo","updated":"20240312151051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第五十二条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312151051-u5p6mi2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312151051-u5p6mi2","updated":"20240312151051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：太阳病,脉浮紧,发热,身无汗,自衄者愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240312151051-o1i3yl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312151051-o1i3yl7","updated":"20240312151051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太阳病,脉浮紧,发热,身无汗,这是麻黄汤，自衄者愈，如果说流鼻血者，愈。所以流鼻血正常。不要把它当病在治。如果四十岁的人没有脉浮紧,发热,身无汗，也在那里流鼻血，你要去治他。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150933-6rw7tkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150933-6rw7tkp"}},{"ID":"20240312150922-9sgwc0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150922-9sgwc0o","updated":"20240312150922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第五十六条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150922-z8730p9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150922-z8730p9","updated":"20240312150922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：脉浮者,病在表,可发汗,宜「麻黄汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150922-8q8rei2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150922-8q8rei2","updated":"20240312150922"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太阳中风、太阳伤寒、太阳温病都会找到浮的脉。会用到麻黄汤一定是无汗，身体全身疼痛，恶寒、无汗的很重。这就是麻黄汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150922-zyee4lj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150922-zyee4lj"}},{"ID":"20240312150914-yqzxv1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150914-yqzxv1o","updated":"20240312150914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第五十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150914-hyoprii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150914-hyoprii","updated":"20240312150914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：脉浮数者,可发汗,宜「麻黄汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150915-0459omy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150915-0459omy"}},{"ID":"20240312150820-b3r6t4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150820-b3r6t4e","updated":"20240312150820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第六十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150820-u4aduyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150820-u4aduyw","updated":"20240312150820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」,脉浮紧,不发汗,因致衄者,「麻黄汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150820-dnwg7dn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150820-dnwg7dn","updated":"20240312150820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒是伤到营卫，脉浮紧，浮是表，紧一定是寒，这个时候病人没有发汗，但是有鼻血。因为麻黄汤里面，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄宣肺，肺打开来。杏仁能够增润肺的津液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，麻黄跟杏仁配在一起的时候，本身病人不会出汗，一定要靠桂枝，因为桂枝是卫分，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝跟麻黄一起的时候把营卫同时解掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，张仲景怕麻黄发散的时候把肺里的津液伤到，所以加杏仁预防伤到津液。我们用麻黄发汗，伤寒是肺，肺主鼻子，一吃麻黄汤，全身血脉加速。有一种病人吃了麻黄汤没有发汗，流鼻血出来，代表病还没有去，只是集中到了鼻子上面。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"全身有三万六千个毛孔加两个（鼻孔），就那两个见到血，毛孔还没有发汗，汗血同源，你看到血，再给他麻黄汤吃发汗才能完全好，如第二剂仍流鼻血，再开第三剂。一般临床看到流鼻血，病人都有发高烧。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150820-n26afr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150820-n26afr5","updated":"20240312150820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"看到吃了麻黄汤流鼻血，诸位不要怕，吓死了，你都不敢动手，你放心，绝对没有问题。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150856-h6mnql5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150856-h6mnql5"}},{"ID":"20240312150857-l9k2dhz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150857-l9k2dhz","updated":"20240312150857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第六十二条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150857-r1pecpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150857-r1pecpm","updated":"20240312150857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」,发汗,解半日许,复烦,脉浮数者,可更发汗,宜「桂枝汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150857-palotmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150857-palotmg","updated":"20240312150857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒，麻黄汤症，给他麻黄汤了，半天很好，半天以后身体又开始不行了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150857-bikcef5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150857-bikcef5","updated":"20240312150857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个意思是说，伤寒的时候你是营卫都伤，你给他麻黄汤以后营解掉了，卫还没有解掉，可能你麻黄汤里面桂枝开的量不够，所以麻黄汤的症没了，但是还有中风的现象，伤寒的现象没了，但是还有中风的症状，这个时候你就给他桂枝汤就可以了。从这里也可以解读出来，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中风伤卫，伤到表气，表水，伤到太阳寒水，伤寒伤到水跟血，统统伤到"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以伤寒的时候，麻黄汤里就有桂枝，意思就在这里。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150820-qg3to83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150820-qg3to83"}},{"ID":"20240312150628-xnsbm7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-xnsbm7s","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百四十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-5yrpnqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-5yrpnqo","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明中风」，脉弦浮大，而短气，腹满，胁下及心痛，久按之气不通，鼻干不得汗，嗜卧，一身面目悉黄，小便难，有潮热，时时哕，耳前后肿，刺之稍瘥。病过十日，外不解，脉续弦者，与「小柴胡汤」。脉但浮，无余证者，与「麻黄汤」。若不尿，腹满加哕者，不治。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-0x5cmxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-0x5cmxs","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉弦浮大，弦是少阳的脉，浮是表症，大是阳明热症的脉。所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"少阳阳明太阳都有"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-dfa1oyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-dfa1oyu","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如现在有病人肝癌，肝癌肝硬化。他就是腹满，心痛，鼻干不得汗，正常人早上起来抹鼻子油油的，实际上这个你的生命啊，是三焦气机很流畅才会光光亮亮的嘛。如果鼻子都灰尘污垢，除了你去坐牢压力很大，还有就是胃气没了。常常打嗝，小便又困难，因为肚子积水了，排不出来，结果你全身是黄的，又有潮热啊，耳朵又有前后肿。“耳前后肿”耳朵一圈是少阳，我们有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"骨三阴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，身上有三个阴骨，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"耳朵后面这个大骨头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"头顶的骨头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是小时候收起来的骨头，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"膝盖的骨头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，叫做"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三阴股"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-k4aen9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-k4aen9n","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阳明的中风，耳前后都肿，我们身上三个阴骨，一个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"泥丸，就是囱骨"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-5vgb7yo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-5vgb7yo","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 6——3"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-nkfkn0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-nkfkn0o","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小孩子两三岁这个骨头开始收。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-sfkypxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-sfkypxd","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去，我们知道有这个东西，没有很肯定，后来黄帝外经出来就看到了里面写的骨三阴。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"临床上怎么解释？如果光看这个不知道它是做什么"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，曾经治疗血癌的时候，小朋友做化疗骨髓移植，结果做完西医宣布无治了。无治以后来找我了，给他吃中药，两个礼拜之后，小孩子胃口也开了，元气也恢复了，再回去一查，没有血癌。没有血癌的时候，西医说是他骨髓换的有效，你已经换了半年前了，做了化疗没效到我手上来的，病人快死了。结果病人家属倾向西医，又找西医治疗，到十一月的时候，有一天突然小朋友，耳朵后面高骨，肿起来一大块，这是骨三阴，代表病进入阴了，这很危险的症状。耳前后肿，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小孩子受惊吓的时候，耳朵后面有鸡爪的血脉，刺刺放点血，受惊的时候可以用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-d92zpqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-d92zpqh","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"骨三阴如果出现实症的时候，代表阴实，为什么会造成阴实？我一再告诉他爸爸，感冒的时候一定要吃中药，绝对不可以吃抗生素，结果小孩子感冒，吃两个礼拜抗生素，吃完以后骨头就肿起来了。阴骨肿起来，病到阴实。病到阴实的时候小孩子很聪明啊，跟爸爸说我们吃倪医师的药就好，因为治好过一次啊，西医坚持不让治疗，说要再做化疗。结果他的爸爸在那模凌两可，我就跟他讲一句话，我讲这句话的目的是要救他儿子，我说这一次一定要西医写下契结书，白纸黑字写好，说我们西医没效，我再帮你动手，否则我不治疗；因为他也不会听你的话，对不对？西医治死了他不会怪西医，只会怪中医，结果呢，小朋友就死在了医院里。这病历都在我手上，本来可以不用死的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-4zu9diw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-4zu9diw","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病进入阴实的时候，阴里面积实的时候，实症在里面。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳明证是阳实，简单讲就是大便堵在肠子里面而已"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。很好处理，当人你处理不好也会死。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大肠癌是不会死人的病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，但是大肠癌你开刀，大肠癌手阳明大肠经阳明经，开刀以后大肠癌移转，大肠癌如果承气汤，大柴胡汤去攻的时候，芒硝可以攻坚，肿瘤可以打开来，再严重里面结石很盛阴实很盛的话，大不了我们用巴豆，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果开刀，移转变成肝癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。从阳明证变成厥阴症，死掉了。临床上西医没有开刀，可以救的回来。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"动了刀以后，跑到肝里面去的时候，就看运气了（百分之三四十机会）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-kh40iu9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-kh40iu9","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“腹满，胁下及心痛，久按之气不通，鼻干不得汗，”这是很危险了，肚子胀，里面阴实结到，一身面目悉黄，眼睛都是黄的，小便难，有潮热，时时哕，常常打嗝。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"看起来像阳明症，实际上，里面阴实结到了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"耳前后肿，代表病已经入阴了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有的人在头顶，大多数看是在耳朵后面，西医叫多发性骨髓瘤，这种东西长在膝盖骨里面，膝盖骨也是阴骨，西医不知道膝盖骨也是代表阴症，代表阴结实，也可以从这个地方判断病好了没有。比如说治疗骨髓瘤，骨髓瘤长得关节上都有，每个脊椎骨关节中间的间隙都长个肿瘤，长个脚膝盖肿瘤，人弯起来不能直立了，因为肿瘤长在那边。你一治疗以后人可以走，你就可以根据脚膝盖的活络情况判断好了没有。所以中医有很多诊断的方式。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-f9yuitk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-f9yuitk","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"刺之稍瘥。病过十日，外不解，脉续弦者，与「小柴胡汤」。脉但浮，无余证者，与「麻黄汤」。若不尿，腹满加哕者，不治。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遇到这种情形，没法治了。但身为医生不能真正不治，还是要抢救一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-wdlwq2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-wdlwq2b","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上看到这种肝硬化，肝癌腹水的时候，如果病人没有动过，就是没有做过切片，也没有栓塞，就是没有动过，我们已经知道他是阴实，这种情况之下，你做栓塞，阴更实。现在告诉诸位怎么治疗，前提实西医没有碰过，西医动手就没办法了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-jwic6cs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-jwic6cs","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肝产生的腹水，你不用管他肝硬化还是肝癌，一个是实症，一个是虚症。实症有个名称叫分消汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个分消汤是从《万病回春》找出来的，这个是对实症，实症上面看到的常常是肝硬化，病人精神还是很好，跟你讲话还是很有力气，颜色很暗但是没有那么虚，肚子胀的很大，脚、下焦肿起来。如果病人给西医动过，处方只有一条路，就是加重剂量，一搏嘛。临床上，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只要西医没有碰过，效果都很好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"分消汤：苍术三、白术三、茯苓三、陈皮二、厚朴二"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-m43nu0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-m43nu0n","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"虚症的时候用补气建中汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，在金匮谈到，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"治肝先实脾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，难就难在怎么把脾实起来。这两个处方呢实症跟虚症，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"苍术、白术、茯苓、陈皮、厚朴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这五味药是相同的，你就按照比例加上去嘛。实症加我们就加一些实脾的药，用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"香附子二，猪苓二，泽泻二，实症用枳实一，大腹皮一，西砂仁一，木香一，灯心草一把，灯心草非常轻，它是包好的，一把还不到一钱。干姜一，生姜一。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是实症。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"分消汤如果把枳实，改为枳壳，就叫做实脾饮，万病回春的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。枳实跟枳壳差异在那里？过去淮河以北称为枳实，淮河以南叫橘子。枳实是先采的。晚点收，里面都干掉了，就剩壳了，就叫枳壳。会用枳实，是因为他里面腹水很多，枳实能够开胃，木之实，是木的果实，味是酸的，肝木克到土，肝脏有问题的时候会克到脾土，所以腹部里会有积水。腹部是脾脏在管，所以一律是健脾利湿的药在里面。我们称为甘淡渗利。甘淡渗利为阳，辛甘发散为阳，处方的时候，麻黄桂枝下去辛甘发散为阳，甘淡通利的药也是阳药。如果肝硬化，脾脏肿大，都是用这个药。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-23l6vfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-23l6vfp","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果病人气色变了，病人气色很暗黄，元气没有了，形没有了。瘦干干的，肚子大，这个来不及了，实症变虚症了，虚症的时候，苍术、白术、茯苓、陈皮、厚朴这五味药不变，但是其他的药要该一下。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"补气建中汤，加人参三，泽泻三，麦门冬三，黄芩二"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，前面五味药加上这四味药，叫补气建中汤。补气建中汤来自《济生方》的臌胀门，有谈到补气建中汤。当你在使用的时候，剂量药开大。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"看到病人有积水的时候，马上就要用。他不是说都会中，太慢用有时候还是会来不及"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当你发现的时候，有时候"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"可以加重剂量"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-6ifl11q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-6ifl11q","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果病人告诉你很冷，心脏力量不够了，这两个处方不管是实症还是虚症，用不到甘草，因为甘草会蓄水。这个时候可以增加生附子，生附子救急的时候，五钱都没关系，把它包在棉布袋里。煮的时候，九碗水煮三碗，一碗不过一钱多。生附子能够壮里阳，心脏里面的阳，把心脏的阳会强起来，所以把心脏的阳强起来并不是炮附子，而是炮附子。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生硫磺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，硫磺是黄色的，三焦系统，命门火就是黄色的，脏腑中间是黄色的，三焦是水道出焉，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"排水的系统要靠硫磺，所以说治水肿的时候，麻黄加术汤，我加一点点硫磺下去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，水肿很快就退了。用硫磺你用到六钱八钱，一两都没有关系。硫磺实际上并没有毒，他的毒只是热的毒，所以硫磺吃下去很热。过去水肿，全身积水都在用硫磺，脚没有力的时候会用硫磺，硫磺是补命门火的。道家有个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"金液丹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那就是硫磺提炼出来的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生硫磺取它的迅捷，速度很快。可以把生硫磺跟附子包在一起。附子黑黑的，生硫磺黄黄的，一个入肾一个入三焦命门，配上补气建中汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。下去小便还排不出来也就只有认了，因为这个方已经很强了嘛，不行就没办法了。你如果会针灸更好。我治病人肝硬化水肿，连续两次，就是分消汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-5awnumf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-5awnumf","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上，肾脏病水肿，也是肿的肚子大，肾脏衰竭，整个脚都肿到，手也开始肿。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾脏病的水肿跟肝病的水肿不太一样"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘淡渗利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘淡渗利为阳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个，我的病人啊，他水肿，他妈妈念经啊，做梦，梦到佛跟他说要吃绿豆，可是他买了绿豆来吃，他跟女儿吃完就一直上厕所，老太太还是不上厕所；怎么办？绿豆甘淡渗利也没错，不管用的话，有个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四神汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，专门用在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾脏病积水的时候"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，四神汤："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"芡实，莲子，薏仁，白果"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我有时候白果改成淮山。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"冬天的时候绿豆改成红豆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，加点"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"龙眼肉，海盐，蔗糖"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天然的糖。夏天的时候，绿豆和四神汤混在一起的时候，煮成稀饭。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘淡渗利的时候是阳，用在肾脏积水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。临床上这样做的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-rer00c4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-rer00c4","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般来说，这种病从开始得病都是我们中医动手，不会有这种结果的，这种结果的出现都是失治导致。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-8ff81pd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-8ff81pd","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果处方下去，病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最迟三天"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便就开始排。如果小便没有出来，堵到里面，严重起来，有几种变化，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一个"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，会成为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"十枣汤症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。有十枣汤症的时候，一定要确定病人还有元气，趁有元气的时候赶快下去。十枣汤把肺里面的痰水统统排掉。病人是但坐不得卧。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-a22ef5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-a22ef5s","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6——4"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-a7ctijh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-a7ctijh","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"躺下去不断的咳嗽。十枣汤攻下去病人会上吐下泻，当时病人的状况，就"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"好像一根空的吸管插到水里面去，按主头这边下面的水就不会下去，吸管上面的口一空，下面的水立即就能排掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个时候都是在利小便，张仲景说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"下痢则"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"死。你如果攻大便就死掉了，你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一定要把小便攻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出来。如果不是十枣汤，梗在里面，过去经方家有用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘遂，牵牛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。甘遂牵牛等量，不是只有这两味药，这是其中两味。会用甘遂牵牛在黄帝外经提到。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加减处方，病人胸胁苦满，小柴胡汤的加减，如果病人没有胃口，没有胸胁苦满，没有恶心的现象，用桂枝汤的加减"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果病人已经"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"没有元气，打嗝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的时候，用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓四逆汤加减"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，茯苓四逆汤加上甘遂牵牛，甘遂牵牛可以各三钱，吃下去病人会大下，小便出来，呕吐。临床上病人会小便出来，但是如果西医碰过，尤其做过栓塞，效果都不好，切片更坏。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-ifaio4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-ifaio4w","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果开始没有积水的时候，不需要去实脾。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夜一点到三点醒来，两年会看到肝癌"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。脸色很暗的时候，这个时候就开始动手了，眼睛周围是青色的，眼睛周围是脾土，木克土，眼周围是青色，就要开始动手，这个时候很简单，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小柴胡汤的加减，如果便秘大柴胡汤的加减，加些行肝气的药，比如玉金，龙胆草，胸胁苦满"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，小柴胡汤，大便排不出来大柴胡汤，胃口不好，加点陈皮。中湿比较盛的话加些白术茯苓，如果湿很热在里面的话，你可以用茵陈蒿汤。这个时候就把它治好，不会有那种结果的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-olqfni0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-olqfni0","updated":"20240312150628"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果治好之后，不要去检查，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"可能里面还有肿瘤在里面，可是他是无害的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，当你外症很好的时候你是没有病的，不要相信西医的说法。真正生病的时候，按照中医的观念看起来的话，张仲景赞成"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃的简单"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，而且不要吃太多，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"五分饱。随时保持一点饿的状态"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这样刺激你的胃气，胃气就会起来。这个时候你要吃很原始的食物。病治到无害的阶段就是好的，不要再去找西医检查，硬去挖病，它是无害的了，你自己给自己吓死。我救回来肝硬化腹水的病人，我跟他说，再去给西医检查，从此我就不理你。跟那个血癌小朋友一样，你只要吃西药我就不救你了，他一吃西医，耳后阴骨就出问题了，三个阴骨一出现问题，我们就知道，阴实了，里面已经结实了，阴实则死，结果死在西医医院里面了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150628-hgxeaqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150628-hgxeaqo"}},{"ID":"20240312150606-ow0pfwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150606-ow0pfwr","updated":"20240312150606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百五十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150606-cunacek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150606-cunacek","updated":"20240312150606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「阳明病」，脉浮，无汗而喘者，发汗则愈，宜「麻黄汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312150606-5u67ou9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312150606-5u67ou9","updated":"20240312150606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脉浮是表症。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄汤治喘"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，还有咳嗽，咳嗽也是喘。麻黄入肺。他表症还有，要先把表解掉。阳明病攻下要先把表解掉，再去攻下。"}]}]}